<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Privacy Policy – Carbon</title>
  <%- include('style') %>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Carbon Gym member app · Last updated: <%= lastUpdated %></p>

    <p>This policy explains what information the Carbon mobile app ("the app") and Carbon Gym ("we", "us") collect,
      why we collect it, and the choices you have. The app is for Carbon Gym members and coaches to manage their
      membership, bookings and attendance.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account details</strong> you give us when you register or a staff member registers you: first and last
        name, email address, phone number, password (stored only in encrypted/hashed form), and optionally your date of
        birth, gender and residential area.</li>
      <li><strong>Membership and activity</strong>: your packages and subscriptions, package requests, class bookings,
        and gym check-ins (date, time and branch).</li>
      <li><strong>Device information for notifications</strong>: if you allow notifications, a push notification token
        for your device and its platform (iOS or Android).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Information we do not collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Camera</strong>: the camera is used only to scan the check-in QR code at the front desk. We do not
        take, store or upload photos or video.</li>
      <li><strong>Face ID / Touch ID / fingerprint</strong>: biometric login is handled entirely by your phone. We never
        receive your face or fingerprint data; the app only learns whether the check succeeded.</li>
      <li>We do not collect your location, contacts or photos, we do not use advertising or third-party tracking, and we
        do not sell your information.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To create and secure your account and log you in.</li>
      <li>To manage your packages, subscriptions, class bookings and remaining sessions.</li>
      <li>To record your check-ins when you scan the QR code at the front desk.</li>
      <li>To send you notifications about your membership, bookings, gym news, and reminders if you haven't visited in a
        while. You can turn notifications off at any time in your phone's settings.</li>
      <li>To email you password reset codes when you request them.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>Your information is used by Carbon Gym staff to run your membership. We share it only with service providers that
      help us operate the app, and only as needed:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>DigitalOcean</strong> – hosts our servers and database.</li>
      <li><strong>Expo, Apple and Google</strong> – deliver push notifications to your device.</li>
      <li><strong>Our email provider</strong> – sends password reset emails.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We may also disclose information if required by law.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep your information while your account is active. When you delete your account, your profile and personal
      details are permanently removed and you can no longer log in. Some records may be kept where the law requires it.</p>

    <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>View and edit</strong> your details any time in <em>Profile → Edit profile</em>.</li>
      <li><strong>Delete your account</strong> in the app from <em>Profile → Delete account</em>, or ask us to delete it
        using the contact details below.</li>
      <li><strong>Turn off notifications</strong> in your phone's settings.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>Data is sent over encrypted HTTPS connections, passwords are stored hashed, and login tokens are kept in your
      phone's secure storage.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>The app is not intended for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If we change this policy, we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>For questions about your data or this policy,
      <% if (contactEmail) { %>email <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a> or<% } %>
      speak to the front desk at any Carbon branch.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
